==List of Contestants and Statistics==
This is a complete list of ''[[Big Brother U.S. (franchise)|Big Brother (US)]]'' contestants from the main series. Here will also be stated each contestants' competition standings and votes against. Take note that the ages and hometowns stated in this table are the contestants' age and residence as of the first day of filming. Only [[Head of Household]] (including reigns that were eventually dethroned) and [[Power of Veto]] competitions will be considered in the "Competition Statistics" column (excluding HOH and/or POVs not won in a competition), while the "Votes Against" column will also include votes that are negated, penalty votes incurred due to rule violations, and those cast by the Head of Household, if tied. [[Jury]] votes are excluded from the table. As of ''[[Big Brother 27 (US)]]'', a total of 353 people have participated across every season.
